  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Research Council of Norway - developement research 2025</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This agreement covers the research portefolie on development financed by the Ministry of foreign affairs through the Norwegian Research Council, according to the Annual Budget Proposition by the Government, subject to Parliamentary appoval. Details about projects financed by the Research Council are available on their website: https://prosjektbanken.forskningsradet.no/en
In the 2025 Budget Proposition, the Government opened up for using part of the support over the aid budget for non-ODA-eligible activities. In the official development statistics, only the ODA-eligible share is included.</narrative>
  </description>
